Verdict: ❌ Does not meet requirements.

Pages & Structure: All 5 required HTML files present. Header duplicated across pages; no footer implemented.

HTML: Inconsistent semantic usage. Markup error in contact.html (broken id attribute). Inline styles used, violating clean separation.

CSS: Overloaded and monolithic. Repeated media queries, duplicated rules, mixed concerns. Guess-based spacing/typography. Fonts not properly imported. Inconsistent hover/focus states.

Pixel Accuracy: Visually close but not pixel-perfect. Spacing, proportions, and typography are approximate.

Responsiveness: Mobile menu functions, but implementation is bloated and breakpoint-heavy.

JavaScript: Overcomplicated. Console logs left in production. Features are mostly cosmetic with no real logic.

Accessibility: Weak. Missing labels, focus states, ARIA roles, and full keyboard support.

Best Practices & SEO:
Missing meta keywords, author
No lazy loading
No noopener noreferrer
No integrity attributes
No README

Remark: Submission by Muhammad Yasir shows effort and feature ambition but fails core requirements: pixel-perfect accuracy, clean maintainable code, accessibility, and production readiness.